  - m_Id: 1000384
    m_Localized: "Bends the magic bullet to the left."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1000385
    m_Localized: "Bends the magic bullet to the left."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1000386
    m_Localized: "Enemy Magic Circle"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1000387
    m_Localized: "Bends the magic bullet upward."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1000388
    m_Localized: "Bends the magic bullet upward."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1000389
    m_Localized: "Enemy Magic Circle"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1000390
    m_Localized: "Bends the magic bullet downward."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1000391
    m_Localized: "Bends the magic bullet downward."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1000392
    m_Localized: "Enemy Magic Circle"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1000393
    m_Localized: "Deal 1 damage to the player."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1000394
    m_Localized: "Deal 1 damage to the player."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1000395
    m_Localized: "Enemy Magic Circle"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1000396
    m_Localized: "Nullifies magic attacks."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1000397
    m_Localized: "Nullifies magic attacks."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1000398
    m_Localized: "Boulder"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1000399
    m_Localized: "An altar stands here, laden with offerings."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1000400
    m_Localized: "Ancient Altar"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1000401
    m_Localized: "A sturdy vault sits before you."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1000402
    m_Localized: "Ancient Vault"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1000403
    m_Localized: "You hear the groans of a monster. It seems to be heading this way."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1000404
    m_Localized: "Signs of the Enemy"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1000405
    m_Localized: "An adventurer lies collapsed in a corner of the passage.\\n\"Please... lend me some money for a potion...\""
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1000406
    m_Localized: "Injured Adventurer"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1000407
    m_Localized: "A device from an ancient civilization hums quietly."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1000408
    m_Localized: "Mana Supply Device"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1000409
    m_Localized: "You meet a peddler wandering the tower."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1000410
    m_Localized: "Peddler"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1000411
    m_Localized: "An old pocket watch lies on the floor. Its hands are still, yet when you hold it to your ear, you think you hear a faint ticking."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1000412
    m_Localized: "Stopped Pocket Watch"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1000413
    m_Localized: "A whisper echoes from somewhere. \"Do you seek power, or knowledge?\""
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1000414
    m_Localized: "Mysterious Voice"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1000415
    m_Localized: "A destroyed guardian leans against the wall."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1000416
    m_Localized: "Guardian's Wreckage"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1000417
    m_Localized: "The shelves hold countless grimoires."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1000418
    m_Localized: "Library of Oblivion"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1000419
    m_Localized: "Debris is scattered everywhere. Some books still look usable."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1000420
    m_Localized: "Hall of Lost Knowledge"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1000421
    m_Localized: "Countless scribbles are carved into the wall.\\n'The clock is still stopped.' 'How many days has it been?' 'Time doesn't move here.'"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1000422
    m_Localized: "Record of Time"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1000423
    m_Localized: "An old recording device is embedded in the wall."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1000424
    m_Localized: "Someone's Memory"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1000425
    m_Localized: "A magic circle flickers erratically."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1000426
    m_Localized: "Unstable Teleport Circle"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1000427
    m_Localized: "In a corner of the old laboratory, an unfinished magic circle remains."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1000428
    m_Localized: "Old Laboratory"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1000429
    m_Localized: "Your whole body burns with heat, and your power grows."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1000430
    m_Localized: "Seek power"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1000431
    m_Localized: "Knowledge of a new magic circle floods into your mind."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1000432
    m_Localized: "Seek knowledge"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1000433
    m_Localized: "You thought it had spotted you, but it vanished somewhere."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1000434
    m_Localized: "Hide and wait for it to pass"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1000435
    m_Localized: "You defeated it. Time to move on."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1000436
    m_Localized: "Defeat it with magic"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1000437
    m_Localized: "You grasped the circle's structure and turned that knowledge into your own power."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1000438
    m_Localized: "Complete the magic circle"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1000439
    m_Localized: "You found a useful spell formula among the notes."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1000440
    m_Localized: "Take the research notes"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1000441
    m_Localized: "The adventurer gave you a grimoire as thanks."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1000442
    m_Localized: "Give 100 Gold"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1000443
    m_Localized: "You picked up a small pouch lying near the adventurer."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1000444
    m_Localized: "Don't give"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1000445
    m_Localized: "You learned of a safe place to rest."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1000446
    m_Localized: "Buy information (100 Gold)"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1000447
    m_Localized: "You kept your purse strings tight."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1000448
    m_Localized: "Don't buy"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1000449
    m_Localized: "You bought a rare enhancement material."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1000450
    m_Localized: "Buy goods (200 Gold)"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1000451
    m_Localized: "The stopped watch gives off a strange power. You feel shielded from the flow of time."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1000452
    m_Localized: "Carry the watch"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1000453
    m_Localized: "Opening the lid reveals a magic circle engraved inside. Fragments of knowledge flow into you, and a card is upgraded."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1000454
    m_Localized: "Examine the watch"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1000455
    m_Localized: "Solving one of the tower's mysteries clears your mind."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1000456
    m_Localized: "Keep reading"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1000457
    m_Localized: "Feeling uneasy, you leave the spot."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1000458
    m_Localized: "Stop reading"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1000459
    m_Localized: "As you turn away from the device, a soft light spills out of it."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1000460
    m_Localized: "Don't listen"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1000461
    m_Localized: "'Seeker of power, never forget its price.' Strangely, your mind calms and strength wells up within you."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1000462
    m_Localized: "Play the recording"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1000463
    m_Localized: "The altar glows, and the power of your magic circles grows."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1000464
    m_Localized: "Offer gold"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1000465
    m_Localized: "The moment you took the offerings, a trap was triggered."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1000466
    m_Localized: "Steal the offerings"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1000467
    m_Localized: "You forgot unnecessary techniques and learned a more refined way to fight."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1000468
    m_Localized: "Discard unneeded memories"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1000469
    m_Localized: "You acquired knowledge of new magic."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1000470
    m_Localized: "Gain knowledge"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1000471
    m_Localized: "You learned new magic from ancient research."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1000472
    m_Localized: "Read the books"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1000473
    m_Localized: "You found some items that could be sold."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1000474
    m_Localized: "Search for valuables"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1000475
    m_Localized: "By analyzing its parts, you learned a new tactic."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1000476
    m_Localized: "Analyze the wreckage"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1000477
    m_Localized: "You salvaged some rare parts."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1000478
    m_Localized: "Salvage the wreckage"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1000479
    m_Localized: "You passed through an unknown space and returned with new power."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1000480
    m_Localized: "Jump in"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1000481
    m_Localized: "You understood how the teleport circle works and applied the technique."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1000482
    m_Localized: "Analyze it"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1000483
    m_Localized: "You learned ancient techniques from the vault's mechanism."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1000484
    m_Localized: "Try to unlock it"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1000485
    m_Localized: "You were hurt by a trap, but treasure lay inside."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1000486
    m_Localized: "Force it open"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1000487
    m_Localized: "You salvaged some valuable parts."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1000488
    m_Localized: "Dismantle it"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1000489
    m_Localized: "The device started up and deployed a protective spell."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1000490
    m_Localized: "Activate it"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1000491
    m_Localized: "Release it to unleash great power."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1000492
    m_Localized: "Anger"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1000493
    m_Localized: "Gain 1 Anger each time you are attacked."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1000494
    m_Localized: "Berserker"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1000495
    m_Localized: "Number of cards drawn increases by the stack count."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1000496
    m_Localized: "Card Plus"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1000497
    m_Localized: "Each time the magic bullet moves 1 tile, its attack increases by the stack count."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1000498
    m_Localized: "Combo"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1000499
    m_Localized: "Maximum cost is reduced by the stack count."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1000500
    m_Localized: "Cost Minus"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1000501
    m_Localized: "Maximum cost is increased by the stack count."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1000502
    m_Localized: "Cost Plus"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1000503
    m_Localized: "Reflects attacks."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1000504
    m_Localized: "Reflect"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1000505
    m_Localized: "Fires magic when it reaches 0."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1000506
    m_Localized: "Attack"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1000507
    m_Localized: "Performs a special attack when it reaches 0."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1000508
    m_Localized: "Special Attack"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1000509
    m_Localized: "Activates by consuming Anger."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1000510
    m_Localized: "Release"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1000511
    m_Localized: "Fires magic."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1000512
    m_Localized: "Normal Attack"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1000513
    m_Localized: "Take damage equal to the stack count."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1000514
    m_Localized: "Poison"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1000515
    m_Localized: "Number of attacks increases by the stack count."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1000516
    m_Localized: "Rapid Fire"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1000517
    m_Localized: "Recover HP every turn."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1000518
    m_Localized: "Regen"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1000519
    m_Localized: "An ability that activates when its count reaches 0."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1000520
    m_Localized: "Spirit Sigil"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1000521
    m_Localized: "Places a magic circle."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1000522
    m_Localized: "Special Attack"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1000523
    m_Localized: "Initial attack power increases by the stack count."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1000524
    m_Localized: "Strength"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1000525
    m_Localized: "Applies Poison."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1000526
    m_Localized: "Technical"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1000527
    m_Localized: "Attack power is reduced by 50%."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1000528
    m_Localized: "Fatigue"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1000529
    m_Localized: "Damage taken increases by 50%."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1000530
    m_Localized: "Weaken"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1000531
    m_Localized: "Luverio"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1000532
    m_Localized: "Azuria"
    m_Metadata:
